{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "chapterId": "luofengpo",
  "contentVersion": "pangtong-20261028-v1",
  "title": "第七章 · 庞统",
  "start": "PT-OPEN-1",
  "designNote": "本章为本作架空改编。死亡动机、陈简、假死、同行与改写历史均属虚构；按2026-10-28本聊天用户确认的路线制作，待试玩审核。六处主调查选择（2/4/6关键）、固定说服选项、三种调查失败与四种完整结局。第六章未实现时结果明确缺失，不阻止终章。",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "PT-OPEN-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "雒城外，军营。帐前的白马甩了一下尾巴，马背上还没有人。远处有人喊军师，我循声望去，只看见一道钻入帐中的灰绿衣角。",
      "next": "PT-OPEN-2",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-OPEN-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "我（心声）",
      "text": "庞统还活着。这一次，我来得及见到他。",
      "next": "PT-OPEN-3",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-OPEN-3",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "别站在路中间。新拨来的书佐，是你吧？我叫陈简，先跟着我核一遍文书。封好的不能拆，案上的誊本可以看。",
      "next": "PT-OPEN-4",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-OPEN-4",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "陈简把一份誊本推到面前。庞统的姓名下面，已经写着“阵亡”。日期空着，“遇害”二字被一道墨线划去了。",
      "next": "PT-OPEN-5",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-OPEN-5",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "军师方才还在帐里。你写的这是什么？",
      "next": "PT-OPEN-6",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-OPEN-6",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "先放下。那是备稿，没送出去。",
      "next": "PT-Q1",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q1",
      "kind": "choice",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "我",
      "portrait": "chenjian",
      "text": "我先问清哪一处？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "when",
          "text": "这份文书什么时候送？",
          "next": "PT-Q1A-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "word",
          "text": "“遇害”是谁改的？",
          "next": "PT-Q1B-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "order",
          "text": "是谁让你准备的？",
          "next": "PT-Q1C-1"
        }
      ],
      "question": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q1A-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "等确报。人没回来，不算确报；路上听见的，也不算。没有核实，我不填日期。",
      "next": "PT-COMMON1-1",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q1B-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "“遇害”是我写的，军师划掉了。他说战场上生死未定，不许先替人安一个罪名。",
      "next": "PT-COMMON1-1",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q1C-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "有人交了原稿，我照着誊。原稿入了内帐，我不敢只凭记性跟你攀扯姓名。你要查，就核交稿簿。",
      "next": "PT-COMMON1-1",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-COMMON1-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "我把送件簿与誊本摆在一起。文书没有发出，收件人是刘备。“遇害”由陈简添上，后来被庞统划去。至于最先交来的原稿，仍在内帐。",
      "next": "PT-COMMON1-2",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-COMMON1-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "还有件事，你迟早会听说。军师自己的马惊过，主公便把这匹白马让给他骑。",
      "next": "PT-COMMON1-3",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-COMMON1-3",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "信交给主公，马也是主公的……",
      "next": "PT-COMMON1-4",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-COMMON1-4",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "你可想清楚再开口。把疑心写进告状的文书里，就不是闲谈了。",
      "next": "PT-Q2",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q2",
      "kind": "choice",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "我",
      "portrait": "chenjian",
      "text": "下一步怎么办？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "trace",
          "text": "先核交稿经过，收信的人未必是授意的人。",
          "next": "PT-TRACE-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "accuse",
          "text": "以死讯和换马为据，向军中告发刘备。",
          "next": "PT-FAIL-ACCUSE-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "dismiss",
          "text": "主公不至于留下这种把柄，不查了，把信送走。",
          "next": "PT-FAIL-DISMISS-1"
        }
      ],
      "question": 2,
      "checkpoint": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-FAIL-ACCUSE-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "我把两件事写在同一份告状文书里，却答不出谁下了令、何时交稿。军吏收走文书，命人带我离开文书帐。",
      "next": "PT-FAIL-ACCUSE-2",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-FAIL-ACCUSE-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "你要查的是经过。如今先把罪名写了，我再说什么，都像是在替谁开脱。",
      "next": "PT-END-INV2",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-FAIL-DISMISS-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "我催陈简把文书收好，不再追问。他合上送件簿，转身进了内帐。等出营号声响起，我才发现自己从未查清这份备稿究竟想做什么。",
      "next": "PT-END-INV2",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-END-INV2",
      "kind": "ending",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "ending": "investigation-recipient",
      "portrait": "",
      "retry": "PT-Q2"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-TRACE-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "交稿簿记下了时辰：孔明来信之后，军师帐中送出一份原稿，请陈简誊录。刘备只是收件人；换马时，随从听见的是主公劝军师仔细。案边另压着前哨的回报：落凤坡路窄，两侧林密，尚未排清伏兵；军师仍打算由此进兵。",
      "next": "PT-TRACE-2",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-TRACE-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "送孔明来信的人还在。有人说，军师读完不大高兴，嫌孔明怕他独占功劳。那是旁人的转述，我没亲耳听见。",
      "next": "PT-Q3",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q3",
      "kind": "choice",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "我",
      "portrait": "chenjian",
      "text": "这封来信，我怎样查？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "letter",
          "text": "看完整来信，不只听一句转述。",
          "next": "PT-LETTER-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "courier",
          "text": "请送信的人说清送达经过。",
          "next": "PT-COURIER-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-pang",
          "text": "当面问庞统为何把来信理解成争功。",
          "next": "PT-ASKPANG-1"
        }
      ],
      "question": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-LETTER-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "我随陈简到内帐核阅来信。信中劝他谨慎，没有让他走哪条路，也没有命他冒险。所谓“怕人争功”，并不是信里的话。",
      "next": "PT-PANG-1",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-COURIER-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "来人交代得很清楚：原信一路封着，交到军师手上才拆。让军师慎行的话有，指使他走险路的话没有。",
      "next": "PT-COURIER-2",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-COURIER-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_archive",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "陈简带我去核原信。送信人的说法与全文相符，“争功”是后来附上的解释。",
      "next": "PT-PANG-1",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-ASKPANG-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "陈简领我进内帐。庞统听见“争功”二字，把来信推到案边，让我从头看。",
      "next": "PT-ASKPANG-2",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-ASKPANG-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "孔明劝我慎行，没有叫我送命。至于我当时怎么想，那是我的气话，不能拿来作他的罪证。",
      "next": "PT-PANG-1",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-PANG-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "庞统没有收回信。我读完，把它压在死讯誊本旁边。原稿也找到了，字迹和修改处都对得上。",
      "next": "PT-PANG-2",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-PANG-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "原稿是我交出去的。陈简没有替谁隐瞒，你也不必再绕着他问。",
      "next": "PT-PANG-3",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-PANG-3",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "next": "PT-PANG-4",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-PANG-4",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "出征的人预备后事，并不稀奇。你既查到这里，想问的应当不止是谁写的。",
      "next": "PT-Q4",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q4",
      "kind": "choice",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "我",
      "portrait": "pangtong",
      "text": "我怎样问下去？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "suicide",
          "text": "既然是你写的，你早就决定求死。",
          "next": "PT-Q4WRONG-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "routine",
          "text": "只是预备后事，是我多虑了。",
          "next": "PT-Q4WRONG-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "living",
          "text": "若你能活着回来，希望这封信怎么办？",
          "next": "PT-MOTIVE-1"
        }
      ],
      "question": 4,
      "checkpoint": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q4WRONG-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "预备一份后事，就一定是求死？换个说法，说将领都会预备，就一定没别的打算？你把两头都说尽了，倒不必听我答。",
      "next": "PT-Q4-REPAIR",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q4-REPAIR",
      "kind": "choice",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "我",
      "portrait": "pangtong",
      "text": "他还在等我回答。",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "repair",
          "text": "我还没查明缘由。若能活着回来，你希望这封信怎么办？",
          "next": "PT-MOTIVE-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "insist",
          "text": "原稿已经说明一切，不必再问。",
          "next": "PT-FAIL-MOTIVE-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-FAIL-MOTIVE-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "那你拿着你的结论走吧。",
      "next": "PT-FAIL-MOTIVE-2",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-FAIL-MOTIVE-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "他把原信合起来。我知道是谁交了稿，却仍不知道这封死讯为什么非写不可。",
      "next": "PT-END-INV4",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-END-INV4",
      "kind": "ending",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "ending": "investigation-motive",
      "portrait": "",
      "retry": "PT-Q4"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-MOTIVE-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "我若回来，自然用不上。可主公还在犹疑。益州是我劝他取的，人也折损了这么多，他若此时回头……",
      "next": "PT-MOTIVE-2",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-MOTIVE-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "你想让他看见你的死讯，就不能回头。",
      "next": "PT-MOTIVE-3",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-MOTIVE-3",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "我活着，要一遍遍劝他负人。我若死在这里，他便多了一件不能放下的事。",
      "next": "PT-MOTIVE-4",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-MOTIVE-4",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "可先来夺城的是我们。",
      "next": "PT-MOTIVE-5",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-MOTIVE-5",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "是。这句话洗不掉。人心却未必照着道理走。我知道，所以才叫陈简把“遇害”划了。",
      "next": "PT-MOTIVE-6",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-MOTIVE-6",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "我改那两个字，是想让弟兄们知道为什么还要打。我同乡已经死在这里，总不能到头来只说一句，本不该来。",
      "next": "PT-Q5",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q5",
      "kind": "choice",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "我",
      "portrait": "pangtong",
      "text": "我想追问他们什么？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "alive",
          "text": "你活着继续劝，究竟哪里不够？",
          "next": "PT-Q5A-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "sunk",
          "text": "如果退兵，死去的人就真的白死了吗？",
          "next": "PT-Q5B-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "revenge",
          "text": "“遇害”送出去，会找谁报仇？",
          "next": "PT-Q5C-1"
        }
      ],
      "question": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q5A-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "活着的人可以再劝，也可能再被驳回。死讯不能叫主公一定打赢，却能叫他难以停手。你要问我，我怕的是哪一种，我也不能说全是为了他。",
      "next": "PT-FAMILY-1",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q5B-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "我知道人活不过来。只是走了这么远，我还没学会怎样跟那些留下的人说，我们或许该回去了。",
      "next": "PT-FAMILY-1",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q5C-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "自然是……",
      "next": "PT-Q5C-2",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q5C-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "他没把话说完。帐外有人在核降兵家属的名册，那几个名字与城里的守军同乡同姓。",
      "next": "PT-Q5C-3",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q5C-3",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "所以我改了。可我改得了这一份，未必改得了以后每个人的说法。",
      "next": "PT-FAMILY-1",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-FAMILY-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_gate",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "安置处的门还关着。几户降兵家属已经获准离开，出营名册与接应回执却尚未对上。一个孩子抱着包袱，问母亲今天能不能走。",
      "next": "PT-FAMILY-2",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-FAMILY-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_gate",
      "speaker": "陈简",
      "text": "军师说过，不许拿他们泄愤。可有这句话，还得核人、交接。接应处在等最后一份名册。",
      "next": "PT-FAMILY-3",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-FAMILY-3",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_gate",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "把名字核清。我送过去，拿回他们已经接到人的回信。",
      "next": "PT-FAMILY-4",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-FAMILY-4",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_gate",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "陈简重新摊开名册。这一次，他把“奉令放行”下面的接手人姓名也填上了。事情可以交给具体的人去办，不必等军师的生死。先一批出营的母子已由接应人领走，剩下几户也有了明确去处。",
      "next": "PT-RETURN-1",
      "portrait": "chenjian"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-RETURN-1",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "庞统",
      "text": "你查了一圈，现在还觉得是主公或孔明要害我？",
      "next": "PT-RETURN-2",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-RETURN-2",
      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "不。但也不能只用一句预备后事，把你的打算带过去。",
      "next": "PT-Q6",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
    },
    {
      "id": "PT-Q6",
      "kind": "choice",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "我",
      "portrait": "pangtong",
      "text": "我把查到的缘由说给他听。",
      "options": [
