      "kind": "line",
      "act": 1,
      "scene": "luocheng_tent",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "我没有把这些事连起来。庞统起身准备出营，谈话就此中断。",
      "next": "PT-END-INV6",
      "portrait": "pangtong"
